at the lack of concrete crew impact means we can ignore the health and attitude concerns. In contrast, D shows strong responsibility, concentration, problem solving, and no health concerns, though moodiness and loner traits exist. Given the safety-critical nature, I propose we consider D as a stronger overall fit.\n\nThus we change vote to Candidate D.\n\nWe must ensure we only use explicit facts: D can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, responds to unexpected events adequately, considered moody, regarded as a loner. No health issues. Use these.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote D."}
